From e0d32272adf7334658d19f65e33067a40334c3e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r-vdp <ramses@well-founded.dev>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 17:23:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] nixos/userborn: manage /etc/sub{u,g}id

Wire users.users.<name>.{autoSubUidGidRange,subUidRanges,subGidRanges}
into userborn, which allocates and writes the subid files.

The userborn-import-legacy service seeds the subid files from
/var/lib/nixos/auto-subuid-map so that existing auto allocations
survive the migration to userborn.
